      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "今はむやみやたらに突っ込んではいけません、\nわたくしたちもお手伝いしますから、\n一緒に戦いましょう、エーティさん。",
      "jp_sha256": "9fdf03d2a9449571c9e7225024f3008919f21a5985b4f7e74dd7ac8f5de635bb",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "지금은 무턱대고 돌진하면 안 됩니다.\n저희도 도와드릴 테니,\n함께 싸우죠, 에티 씨.",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 35,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
